  "editorial": "functools.partial(int, base=16) binds the base so the caller passes only the string. The bound base is the point of partial. ValueError is the garbage path, including the empty string.",
  "reference_solution": "def solve(text):\n    try:\n        return int(text, 16)\n    except ValueError:\n        return \"error\"\n"
}
